# A completion that is not first-terminal-wins: a lost record is rewritten later.
MODULE: TerminalIsFinalLateCompletionOverwrites
TARGET: TerminalIsFinal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a runner's late completion overwrites a record already declared lost
PERTURBS: Finish

--- FIND
    /\ IF Terminal(o)
       THEN UNCHANGED <<opState, opOutcome, opResultRem>>
       ELSE IF opSeen[o] = NoOp
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF FALSE
       THEN UNCHANGED <<opState, opOutcome, opResultRem>>
       ELSE IF opSeen[o] = NoOp
--- END
